<title>SWEDEN: SCA sees newsprint price cut.</title>
<headline>SCA sees newsprint price cut.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forest products group SCA said on Wednesday it will probably have to cut newsprint prices before the end of the year.</p>
<p>&quot;We have had some positive signals from the U.S. on developments in September but one should still reckon with a reduction of newsprint prices before 1997,&quot; SCA president Sverker Martin-Lof told a news conference.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
